# Reviewed secret-scan false positives. One per line:
# <path><TAB><fixed substring of the matching line><TAB><family>
# family is `assignment` (default when omitted) or `literal`.
#
# Only the matching line is suppressed; the rest of the file is still scanned.
# An entry that suppresses nothing fails the gate, so stale approvals cannot
# silently authorize a future line. Keep this file empty unless a human has
# verified that the exact match is not a credential.
